              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós loohidá' nira hardáh gan ar kii/, nee i baloó dahiiká baraá gixsa. Adoorí an adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeít, aníng gixsarí a xuúm as daanduú ilaiwa/amer'eé' nee as daanduú sagadiyusmooeé' Daudi, gixsarí a xuúm nee ngiri ba/amís.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
